note =========================================================================
note c: mxfp8_gemv_grouped8_fast -- 1-launch 8-expert MXFP8 GEMV (half-warp 16 lanes/row, 32 rows/CTA, SMEM x + SMEM LUT)
note Args: x_rec(R0:1), W_fp8(R2:3), sw(R4:5), ids(R6:7), lut(R8:9), C(R10:11), K(48), N(52), x_stride(56).
note Grid: (ceil(N/32), 8, 1), Block: 256, SMEM: 12288. K % 128 == 0, K <= 2304.
note =========================================================================
fn mxfp8QuadMac w0 ulong w1 ulong xBase ulong to void
ic 18 0 w0 Z 255 cwAlu1
ic 18 4 w1 Z 255 cwAlu1
for j ulong 3
bIdx = add j 1
sh = mul bIdx 8
ic 17 bIdx w0 Z sh cwAlu1
ic 17 add 4 bIdx w1 Z sh cwAlu1
end
for j ulong 3
bIdx = add j 1
ic 18 bIdx bIdx Z 255 cwAlu1
ic 18 add 4 bIdx add 4 bIdx Z 255 cwAlu1
end
for i ulong 8
icImm 8 i i Z 4 cwAlu1
end
ic 49 8 0 Z 0 cwLd
ic 49 9 1 Z 0 cwLd
